{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"It applies a fixed nominal annual rate of interest divided by the frequency of payments to a series of equal payments, with regular payments at the end of each period and annuity payments at the beginning.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"annuity-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"it","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"annuity-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["annuity-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"it","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Applica un tasso annuo nominale fisso diviso per la frequenza dei pagamenti a una serie di pagamenti uguali. I pagamenti ordinari avvengono alla fine di ogni periodo, mentre i pagamenti dovuti in rendita avvengono all’inizio.","record_id":"3a70014b52f5ef049908ac5c86ecae9f0b8c089b80d2aeece9a6e8e7d6c1cf00","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":1.2995344096250108,"source":"It applies a fixed nominal annual rate divided by the payment frequency to a series of equal payments. Ordinary payments happen at each period’s end; annuity-due payments happen at the beginning. It does not model fees, taxes, variable rates or a specific insurer’s contract.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"cd98a0edf1c8ace46a9cb275ad87467dc4b59ddb56b491233742c140df9ee1ff","status":"needs-review","translation":"Applica un tasso annuo nominale fisso diviso per la frequenza dei pagamenti a una serie di pagamenti uguali. I pagamenti ordinari avvengono alla fine di ogni periodo, mentre i pagamenti dovuti in rendita avvengono all’inizio.","truncated":false,"warnings":["back_negation"]}
